EMBEDDED COURSE / TRAINING CONTENT
===============================================================================
This platform is designed to host learning content (courses, lessons, learning
atoms, case studies, assessment questions) whose intellectual property may
belong to a party other than Conform-Edge — most notably Annex Quality, whose
authored training material may be delivered through this platform under a
separate content-licensing arrangement.

The data model enforces this separation explicitly:
  - `LearningAtom.owner` and `LearningAtom.licenseClass` record which party
    authored a given piece of content and under what license it is used
    (e.g. "public_domain", "cc_by", "annex_quality", "proprietary", "burrana").
  - `EvidenceClassification` / `HfEvidence.classification` record the
    confidentiality of source evidence, independent of who owns any content
    derived from it.

As of this repository's current state, no Annex Quality-authored course
content is embedded in the seed data or fixtures — the seed data used
throughout this codebase's test suite is synthetic, written for testing
purposes only, and is Conform-Edge software-test material, not licensed
third-party course content. This NOTICE establishes the boundary in advance
of any such content being loaded, so that a future content import does not
require retrofitting attribution.

Where content IS later loaded with `owner: "Annex Quality"` (or any other
third-party owner value), that content:
  - remains the intellectual property of its stated owner,
  - is used by this platform under whatever license arrangement governs that
    content's delivery, separate from the software license in LICENSE,
  - is NOT covered by the Conform-Edge software copyright above, and
  - must not be redistributed outside the terms of its own content license,
    regardless of the software's license terms.

